528	     * case-insensitively) and {@code postcode} while carrying a different normalized telephone. The
529	     * new owner's postcode must be present for a soft match to be possible. When several existing
530	     * owners qualify the one with the lowest id is chosen. Returns the matching owner's id, or
531	     * {@code null} when there is no soft match. This is evaluated after the hard-duplicate check has
532	     * already passed, so any owner sharing the lastName and postcode necessarily differs in telephone.
533	     *
